            "sid": "1KI 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaprofwetu wamufuntishili munjila chachitiyiliyi, hakwila nindi, Yowu muntu waNzambi wadikaŋili nezu damukanwa kaYehova; dichichanamuhaniniyi Yehova kudi mutupa, namutaboli dehi, namujahi dehi, mwomwizu daYehova dahosheliyi nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuhosha nawanyanindi, nindi, Nlemenenu sadi hachimbulu. Hiya kulema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuya, hakuwana chibimbi chindi anachinati munjila, nichimbulu nimutupa anemani kwakwihina chibimbi. Mutuŋa kudya chibimbi nehi, nikutabula chimbulu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaprofwetu hakunyamuna chibimbi chamuntu waNzambi, hakuchishaha chimbulu, hakuchifuntisha. Owu kaprofwetu wakashinakaji hakufunta kumukala, hakumudila, hakumuŋika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamikili chibimbi chindi mwijamu dindi yomwenindi, wamudilili nindi, Yayo mana kwami!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili namujiiki dehi, hakuyila anyanindi, nindi, China kafwamimwakanji ikaŋa mwijamu namutunajiiki muntu waNzambi. Mwaka kamikaŋa mafwahami hamu namafwahindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa izu dakumuhoshesha nezudakudi Yehova dabidikiliyi kameŋa kamuBeteli, dabidikiliyi nimatala ejima ahayinaŋanaŋa yamunyikala yamuSamariya, dakamwekana chalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufuma henohu Yerobowami kufunta munjila yindi yatama nehi, saŋi elilayi atupristu akuyinaŋanaŋa akufumisha hadi antu, hakukunjikaonsu anakeŋiyi wowu, kulonda akekalaŋa atupristu akuyinaŋanaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chena chumichi chabalumukili hinshidi kudi mutaŋa waYerobowami mwaka amoni kuyifumishaku, hiyakuyijilumuna afumi hewulu deseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
